### Method classification

| Function           | Method                                              | Mutual-exclusivity |
|--------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|--------------------|
| compute_team_ev    | Naive marginal sum (Σ per-rider total_ev + max + ε) | NOT modeled        |
| simulate_stage     | Plackett-Luce Monte Carlo (n_sims=10,000 joint draws) | YES (one rider per finish position) |

